/*
 * motir.co ON CLOUDFLARE WORKERS (MOTIR-10634 · MOTIR-10643).
 *
 * The static half of the site is `astro build`'s `dist/`, served as Workers
 * static assets with no Worker script in front of it: no request runs code.
 *
 *  • `html_handling: "auto-trailing-slash"` (the default, written down)
 *    serves `price.html` at `/price` and `de.html` at `/de`, the unslashed
 *    addresses every canonical names (`astro.config.mjs`, `build.format`).
 *  • `not_found_handling: "404-page"` answers a path with no file with the
 *    nearest `404.html` above it and a 404 status — `de/404.html` for a
 *    mistyped `/de/…`, `404.html` for the rest.
 *  • `public/_redirects` carries the `/en` → `/` 308s.
 *
 * The deploy job stays held until the CI story (MOTIR-10637) points it here;
 * `pnpm start` serves the build locally through `wrangler dev`.
 */
{
  "$schema": "node_modules/wrangler/config-schema.json",
  "name": "motir-marketing",
  "compatibility_date": "2026-11-01",
  "assets": {
    "directory": "./dist",
    "html_handling": "auto-trailing-slash",
    "not_found_handling": "404-page",
  },
}
